        "original_id": "5c3ffd03-d42f-5799-9d59-0ba6b8ad36f7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Henry Grace, Dwight D. Eisenhower\n- Roles: Art director, President of the United States, Army general, Politician\n- Awards: Academy Award, Best Art Direction\n\nFacts:\n- Dwight David \"Ike\" Eisenhower was born on October 14, 1890.\n- Henry Grace won an Academy Award and received twelve additional Academy Award nominations in the Best Art Direction category.\n- Dwight D. Eisenhower was an American politician and Army general.\n- Dwight D. Eisenhower served as the 34th President of the United States from 1953 to 1961.\n- Dwight D. Eisenhower died on March 28, 1969.",
